Subject: [PATCH] fix(renovate): majors open on the run that pushes them, and
 lock-file maintenance takes the first hourly PR slot

Follow-up to #39 (reddoorla/reddoor-maintenance#1688). (1) packageRule major ->
prCreation: immediate; the majors rule's automerge: false is untouched. (2) packageRule
lockFileMaintenance -> prPriority: 1. (3) validate.yml refuses either's removal, and
refuses prCreation: immediate on digest.

Digests are deliberately left out (reddoor-workspace decisions/2026-10-24-1436): a digest
has no release timestamp, so under minimumReleaseAge it is never branched, and made
immediate it opens behind a stability status that never clears and takes an hourly slot
ahead of both grouped PRs.

Proven on reddoorla/reddoor-starter#208, real runs, Renovate 44.181.3, round 2
(probe/1688-r2-*), production preset at a726791 with and without these rules:

r2-majors-control (majors only, prHourlyLimit 0):
  INFO: Branch created (branch=probe/1688-r2-majors-control/major-vitest-monorepo)
  DEBUG: Branch status pending, current sha: 1e8c08b9ecac4f8f9fce3555dd7c54c090eee1b6
  INFO: Branch created (branch=probe/1688-r2-majors-control/prismicio-svelte-3.x)
  DEBUG: Branch status pending, current sha: 5a068612119dbc70b99c3dfb6786539ce162044d
r2-majors-final:
  INFO: Branch created / INFO: PR created (major-vitest-monorepo, reddoor-starter#217)
  INFO: Branch created / INFO: PR created (prismicio-svelte-3.x, reddoor-starter#218)
r2-slots-control (prHourlyLimit 2):
  INFO: PR created (all-minor-patch, #219)
  INFO: PR created (held-minor-patch, #220)
  DEBUG: Hourly PRs limit reached (major-vitest-monorepo, prismicio-svelte-3.x)
  DEBUG: Hourly PRs limit reached (branch=probe/1688-r2-slots-control/lock-file-maintenance)
r2-slots-final:
  INFO: PR created (lock-file-maintenance, #216)
  INFO: PR created (all-minor-patch, #221)
  DEBUG: Hourly PRs limit reached (held-minor-patch, major-vitest-monorepo, prismicio-svelte-3.x)
Every arm, digest:
  DEBUG: Skipping branch creation due to internal status checks not met
  (branch=probe/<arm>/actions-setup-node-digest)

Round 1 (44.181.2, rules as first decided, majors and digests): slots-test opened
lock-file maintenance (#210) and the digest (#211), and neither grouped PR got a branch;
the digest PR's status: renovate/stability-days pending "Updates have not met minimum
release age requirement".

